  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Guildhouse School, London is a co-educational sixth form college and pre-A-Level school in central London (Bloomsbury), part of CATS Global Schools.",
      "Programmes: GCSE (Year 10-11), A-Level (2-year), University Foundation Programme (UFP), and Pre-A Level for international students needing additional preparation.",
      "Located in historic Regency townhouses on Bloomsbury Square, 1 minute from Holborn Tube. UFP graduates report 70% Russell Group university acceptance.",
      "International tuition: £37,365/year; EU rate £31,155; UK domestic rate £21,510."
    ],
    "keyFacts": [
      "Co-educational sixth form, ages 14-19",
      "Central London (Bloomsbury Square)",
